{
  "$comment": [
    "Pinned, self-hosted media tools bundled next to OrgZ (ffmpeg, flac, lame).",
    "sha256 = PENDING means the asset hasn't been vendored + uploaded to our release yet;",
    "fetch-encoders.ps1 skips those (runtime falls back to a PATH install).",
    "",
    "To vet + (re)host a build:",
    "  1. pwsh scripts/fetch-encoders.ps1 -Vendor            # downloads upstream, hashes, stages to scripts/staged/, writes the sha256 values back here",
    "  2. create a GitHub release tagged '<release>' on <repo> and upload everything in scripts/staged/",
    "  3. commit this file (now with real hashes)",
    "Thereafter every build/release fetches OUR copy and verifies the hash — a re-tag or",
    "compromise upstream can't reach users, because the bytes come from us and are checked."
  ],
  "repo": "FoxCouncil/OrgZ",
  "release": "encoders-1",
  "tools": {
    "win-x64": [
      {
        "out": "ffmpeg.exe",
        "asset": "ffmpeg-win-x64.exe",
        "sha256": "b1253f2a453ebb48b1b5e537b27f13f299514532829b68b9a7586a5183bf8e00",
        "license": "LGPL-2.1",
        "upstreamUrl": "https://github.com/BtbN/FFmpeg-Builds/releases/download/latest/ffmpeg-master-latest-win64-lgpl.zip",
        "archive": "zip",
        "entry": "ffmpeg.exe"
      },
      {
        "out": "flac.exe",
        "asset": "flac-win-x64.exe",
        "sha256": "d80c96700d17ac08bf8cc517147a62dd12241544ced0315a1e5832c436d69264",
        "license": "BSD",
        "upstreamUrl": "https://downloads.xiph.org/releases/flac/flac-1.4.3-win.zip",
        "archive": "zip",
        "entry": "flac-1.4.3-win/Win64/flac.exe"
      },
      {
        "out": "libFLAC.dll",
        "asset": "libFLAC-win-x64.dll",
        "sha256": "9f46d67fe71b59a8cfc83046c2802dca88ee92bfd97017330944db577ad58f4d",
        "license": "BSD",
        "upstreamUrl": "https://downloads.xiph.org/releases/flac/flac-1.4.3-win.zip",
        "archive": "zip",
        "entry": "flac-1.4.3-win/Win64/libFLAC.dll"
      },
      {
        "out": "libFLAC++.dll",
        "asset": "libFLACpp-win-x64.dll",
        "sha256": "30c07adc9f6df46b5845e765bf6274c4c4f883ed5c838b6857dd830150b629f8",
        "license": "BSD",
        "upstreamUrl": "https://downloads.xiph.org/releases/flac/flac-1.4.3-win.zip",
        "archive": "zip",
        "entry": "flac-1.4.3-win/Win64/libFLAC++.dll"
      },
      {
        "out": "lame.exe",
        "asset": "lame-win-x64.exe",
        "sha256": "cdee20466ac2d1b6442fe83ede488586683bbacac0fc653900637292e735b97b",
        "license": "LGPL-2.0",
        "upstreamUrl": "https://www.rarewares.org/files/mp3/lame3.100.1-x64.zip",
        "archive": "zip",
        "entry": "lame.exe",
        "referer": "https://www.rarewares.org/mp3-lame-bundle.php"
      }
    ],
    "linux-x64": [
      {
        "out": "ffmpeg",
        "asset": "ffmpeg-linux-x64",
        "sha256": "1f1a6eaba98ccb1c1c4f059ae243e72df1073d1110dacdcba4c921d55601a3c1",
        "license": "LGPL-2.1",
